# Codex writes runtime state, caches, sessions, auth, and sandbox temp files
# into ~/.codex. None of it should be chezmoi-managed (it also contains secrets
# in auth.json and leaves dangling symlinks under tmp/ that break source reads).
# Keep only the explicitly authored config/plugin files under .codex.
.codex/*
!.codex/AGENTS.md
!.codex/config.toml
!.codex/hooks.json
!.codex/rate-limit-marketplace
.codex/rate-limit-marketplace/**/__pycache__
